WEBVTT

01:50.140 --> 01:53.410
Everyone already left because they were worried about their families.

01:55.360 --> 01:59.050
Cell phones aren't connecting and we can't call the fire department.

02:02.140 --> 02:04.440
Perhaps Hidaka-san is...

02:04.440 --> 02:05.410
Takashi!

02:05.410 --> 02:06.670
No, not that!

02:06.840 --> 02:10.580
At that time, I think I saw a shadow of a red person,

02:11.300 --> 02:13.430
and Hidaka-san, too, was...

02:13.770 --> 02:15.650
Takashi, you saw it too, didn't you?

02:17.040 --> 02:21.440
That red guy has been on Yumemi's mind since last summer.

02:22.230 --> 02:25.130
Yumemi was confused and troubled...

02:25.760 --> 02:30.280
Even so, I couldn't protect her.

02:30.280 --> 02:35.200
But it seems like Hidaka-san went of her own free will.

02:35.790 --> 02:37.700
She's doing it in order to protect us.

02:39.770 --> 02:44.550
She thinks she has no choice because that red guy said something about the end of the world...

02:45.970 --> 02:48.300
Could this be linked to that?

02:49.150 --> 02:52.470
Ichiko, do you want to chase after Yumemi?

02:57.120 --> 02:57.520
Let's go.

02:59.280 --> 03:00.560
Um...

03:03.690 --> 03:05.480
What are you doing, Ichiko-san?!

03:05.690 --> 03:07.670
That's absurd!

03:07.670 --> 03:08.740
Ichiko-san, no!

03:08.740 --> 03:13.700
You can't do that!

03:14.900 --> 03:17.200
This is the last batch of evacuees.

03:17.620 --> 03:19.830
After we confirm their safety, we'll be returning to the palace.

03:20.210 --> 03:22.120
Are you worried about the Union?

03:22.120 --> 03:24.490
Yeah, we can't predict what they're going to do.

03:25.160 --> 03:27.210
It's the same everywhere.

03:27.210 --> 03:29.540
The world is beginning to fall.

03:29.540 --> 03:32.220
No country has enough strength left to do anything.

03:33.680 --> 03:35.550
That's good, then.

03:40.720 --> 03:42.770
You seem to be a bit nervous.

03:42.770 --> 03:44.720
Yeah...

03:44.720 --> 03:47.600
Um... What am I supposed to do for the preparation?

03:47.600 --> 03:50.030
Please look into the mirror.

03:51.610 --> 03:54.820
The only way to avert the destruction we're facing...

03:54.820 --> 03:59.790
...is to revive the circulation of the almighty Akuto.

04:00.470 --> 04:04.540
The circulation of Akuto will give a form to that pillar of light.

04:04.710 --> 04:10.810
With a form, that pillar of light will become the bridge that connects our two worlds.

04:12.740 --> 04:16.840
However, to give form to that pillar of light,

04:16.840 --> 04:20.460
there's something you still need.

04:20.460 --> 04:25.530
In order to know what that is,
please look into the mirror now.

04:29.040 --> 04:31.430
Something I still need?

04:34.040 --> 04:36.320
So if I know what it is...

04:37.030 --> 04:39.170
The preparation will be complete.

04:39.790 --> 04:44.330
Stand in front of the mirror and look at the reflection.

04:45.100 --> 04:49.630
What is reflected will be you - in other words, your spirit.

04:53.410 --> 04:58.340
Face your reflection through the mirror, understand it,

04:58.340 --> 05:00.080
and then accept your spirit.

05:00.610 --> 05:03.770
After that has been achieved, the preparation will be complete.

05:08.770 --> 05:13.440
If I can understand and accept the reflection...

05:15.250 --> 05:18.030
Munto, wait for me.

05:44.740 --> 05:46.740
T-This is...

05:46.740 --> 05:52.810
Darkness is taking over due to the distortion created by the accelerated decrease of Akuto.

05:54.360 --> 05:59.280
As expected, Munto cannot save the Heavens by himself.

05:59.850 --> 06:01.460
If I don't hurry...

06:11.620 --> 06:13.030
Uh...

06:13.030 --> 06:17.910
What this mirror projects are people, the world, the past, and the future.

06:20.410 --> 06:22.910
The world is the model of the spirit.

06:22.910 --> 06:25.490
The spirit is the mirror of the world.

06:25.490 --> 06:27.170
The future is a person's face.

06:27.170 --> 06:29.090
The past is a person's back.

06:29.790 --> 06:34.070
When they become one, it's known as the spirit.

06:35.730 --> 06:37.940
Don't be afraid, Miss Yumemi.

06:39.040 --> 06:39.780
Look.

07:12.910 --> 07:19.900
Your world is also welcoming the moment of destruction, just like the Heavens.

07:27.070 --> 07:29.500
Takashi, you don't need to come along!

07:30.320 --> 07:31.710
It's dangerous! Go back already!

07:31.860 --> 07:33.890
This is crazy, Ichiko-san!

07:33.890 --> 07:35.590
Even if we do this, Hidaka-san won't...

07:36.660 --> 07:39.530
Being alone, Yumemi is definitely troubled right now.

07:40.060 --> 07:42.470
It's because I didn't believe in her...

07:43.300 --> 07:44.850
It's because I doubted her...

07:45.320 --> 07:47.270
What are you talking about?!

07:47.270 --> 07:48.360
I don't get you!

07:48.360 --> 07:54.070
I didn't believe in Yumemi, who went forward by herself for our sake.

07:54.070 --> 07:56.420
I didn't have the courage to believe in her.

07:56.420 --> 07:58.780
But this time, I'll...

08:04.860 --> 08:08.650
Right now, those people are about to disappear.

08:09.620 --> 08:14.250
Along with your world, they're about to be swallowed by darkness.

08:15.190 --> 08:20.050
And now, along with them, your spirit is about...

08:20.380 --> 08:22.050
...to break.

08:24.460 --> 08:26.540
No matter how small it is,

08:26.540 --> 08:31.060
a thing that's created by a person can reflect that person's spirit.

08:31.870 --> 08:35.500
In order to know their shapeless spirits,

08:35.500 --> 08:39.070
people reflect their spirits and create the world.

08:39.770 --> 08:43.910
The world is actually created by people's spirits.

08:43.910 --> 08:46.700
The world is a reflection of people's spirits.

08:48.080 --> 08:52.450
Right now, that world is plunging into chaos and is about to disappear.

08:56.630 --> 08:57.330
Suzume!

08:59.350 --> 09:00.540
Don't move...

09:02.080 --> 09:04.120
Ichiko-san, I'm coming to help you now!

09:04.120 --> 09:05.550
You stay where you are!

09:06.040 --> 09:09.200
Everything your eyes see is a person's spirit.

09:09.800 --> 09:13.890
That applies to what you see right here, and to what you'll see in the future.

09:21.420 --> 09:23.610
Ichiko! Suzume!

09:36.250 --> 09:37.620
No!

09:55.240 --> 09:56.270
Yumemi.

10:23.530 --> 10:26.040
Akuto is the wave of a spirit.

10:26.040 --> 10:27.100
A spirit is...

10:27.100 --> 10:30.220
From Akuto, the world is granted form.

10:30.220 --> 10:32.610
People's spirits gave the world...

10:32.610 --> 10:35.100
The world is created by spirits.

10:35.100 --> 10:36.930
My spirit is...

10:37.860 --> 10:40.030
The world is in chaos.

10:41.730 --> 10:43.990
The world and the spirit are one.

10:43.990 --> 10:46.870
Did I break it?

10:48.160 --> 10:50.200
At the end... destruction.

10:50.990 --> 10:53.580
It's going to be destroyed?

10:53.580 --> 10:55.220
On the other side... darkness.

10:56.830 --> 10:59.050
The world is going to close...

10:59.770 --> 11:01.170
The future is darkness.

11:01.170 --> 11:04.460
Is my spirit that darkness?

11:04.460 --> 11:05.970
That darkness is the spirit.

11:05.970 --> 11:07.230
It can't be...

11:07.230 --> 11:08.750
The future is your spirit.

11:08.750 --> 11:12.630
I'm sorry, I'm already...

11:19.920 --> 11:20.840
Yumemi.

11:22.240 --> 11:23.730
Don't close your heart.

11:26.600 --> 11:29.340
Open your eyes and look, Yumemi.

11:34.780 --> 11:38.380
If you sink into that darkness, the world will end.

11:39.880 --> 11:41.720
The world will be sealed in darkness!

11:43.790 --> 11:46.260
Save me, I...

11:46.260 --> 11:48.410
Yumemi, have you forgotten?

11:48.410 --> 11:51.240
You broke through the continuum with your own will.

11:51.240 --> 11:53.640
You passed the wall by believing in your own strength.

11:55.500 --> 12:00.390
You're here in order to divert the darkness and call upon the light.

12:00.980 --> 12:03.970
I can't, because...

12:03.970 --> 12:04.900
The future is already...

12:05.590 --> 12:10.900
The future still isn't set in stone; you have to give shape to the future you desire.

12:11.180 --> 12:15.030
But my spirit destroyed the future!

12:15.660 --> 12:18.890
Now that you understand that, you can change.

12:19.480 --> 12:21.900
Yumemi, believe in yourself.

12:22.420 --> 12:26.000
Only you can give shape to the future that you desire.

12:27.500 --> 12:32.180
Believe in yourself, Yumemi! You can open up the future!

12:33.010 --> 12:34.920
You have the spirit that can give birth to dreams!

12:36.250 --> 12:39.140
You also have bonds that must never be lost.

12:44.650 --> 12:49.400
You still have people you want to protect!

13:06.530 --> 13:07.580
Ichiko-san!

13:14.610 --> 13:15.970
Suzume! Ichiko!

13:16.790 --> 13:17.800
Yumemi!

13:33.040 --> 13:34.480
That's...

13:59.170 --> 14:00.110
What...?

14:00.110 --> 14:01.650
Where are we?!

14:01.650 --> 14:02.930
What am I-

14:11.800 --> 14:13.440
Yumemi!

14:13.440 --> 14:14.420
You're all right!

14:14.420 --> 14:15.920
We caught up!

14:15.920 --> 14:17.620
I was worried sick.

14:17.620 --> 14:20.310
It's all because you ran off by yourself...

14:20.310 --> 14:22.380
You were going to abandon us.

14:25.690 --> 14:29.310
But Suzume and I were climbing the Ferris wheel-

14:31.090 --> 14:32.460
You came from the sky!

14:33.150 --> 14:37.840
Yeah, because I really wanted to save you and Suzume.

14:39.640 --> 14:43.100
I wanted to be with you two, so I brought you two here.

14:45.950 --> 14:48.680
Then this is... that floating island?

14:54.050 --> 14:55.250
We're here!

14:55.250 --> 14:57.250
It actually exists!

14:57.250 --> 14:59.220
But... What should I do?

14:59.220 --> 15:00.770
I don't know how to fly.

15:00.770 --> 15:02.530
How do I go back?

15:05.650 --> 15:08.190
Hello, um...

15:09.730 --> 15:11.030
She's Ryuely-san.

15:11.030 --> 15:14.160
She's from this country, and she took good care of me.

15:14.160 --> 15:16.080
Oh, really?

15:16.080 --> 15:19.990
Nice to meet you, I'm Ono Ichiko.

15:19.990 --> 15:21.820
My name is Imamura Suzume.

15:21.820 --> 15:24.550
Uh... Does she understand Japanese?

15:25.170 --> 15:28.590
Ichiko, I don't have time to explain everything.

15:31.470 --> 15:33.090
I was really shocked.

15:33.090 --> 15:37.070
This is a future that even <i>I didn't foresee.</i>

15:37.360 --> 15:39.570
She can talk.

15:40.040 --> 15:44.120
Now, Miss Yumemi, please give shape to the future you wish for.

15:44.120 --> 15:47.830
The preparations are complete; Munto is waiting for you.

15:48.670 --> 15:49.640
Munto?

15:53.580 --> 15:55.390
You can't! Yumemi!

15:55.390 --> 15:57.650
Don't tell me you're planning to leave by yourself again!

15:57.650 --> 15:58.460
Ichiko...

15:58.170 --> 15:59.020
Yumemi!

15:59.020 --> 16:03.070
At that time, I couldn't fully believe in you.

16:03.070 --> 16:06.370
I let you go all by yourself. I'm sorry...

16:06.370 --> 16:08.930
I was really scared back then!

16:08.930 --> 16:11.090
But I won't allow myself to make the same mistake...

16:11.090 --> 16:12.220
Ichiko, listen to-

16:12.220 --> 16:15.360
No! Suzume and I are here to bring you back!

16:15.700 --> 16:18.980
We've finally caught up to you, so we won't ever let you go again!

16:19.300 --> 16:20.230
Ichiko...

16:20.230 --> 16:23.280
No! If you're going somewhere, we're coming with you!

16:23.680 --> 16:24.820
Let's go together.

16:24.820 --> 16:26.920
I said no, I-

16:30.220 --> 16:31.090
Really?!

16:31.090 --> 16:33.390
Even if it's the end of the world, I'll go!

16:33.390 --> 16:35.020
Thank you, Ichiko.

16:36.070 --> 16:37.590
Suzume, you can come too.

16:37.880 --> 16:40.790
Okay! As long as it's a place that you want to go!

16:40.790 --> 16:42.410
Thank you, Suzume.

16:49.050 --> 16:54.770
With your courage and the strength and gentleness of these children,

16:55.860 --> 16:56.770
it will definitely work.

16:59.940 --> 17:01.490
All right, go.

17:02.090 --> 17:03.950
Go towards your futures.

17:29.400 --> 17:31.180
There he is.

17:35.150 --> 17:40.270
Hey, Yumemi, about our futures that person mentioned...

17:56.070 --> 17:59.090
I see, so it's there.

17:59.800 --> 18:02.000
Munto is waiting for us there.

18:05.340 --> 18:09.550
All right, so how do you plan to get there?

18:10.120 --> 18:11.940
Considering we don't have much time...

18:16.070 --> 18:18.440
Don't tell me we're going to jump from here...

18:19.170 --> 18:19.980
We'll fly.

18:29.010 --> 18:31.170
Can I ask something?

18:31.170 --> 18:31.950
What is it?

18:32.660 --> 18:34.080
Am I able to fly?

18:36.980 --> 18:39.920
There's no one who can't fly, Ichiko!

18:39.920 --> 18:42.210
You just laughed, didn't you?

18:42.210 --> 18:46.460
I'm sorry, I never thought I'd be giving you encouragement.

18:50.410 --> 18:51.590
But Suzume is...

18:51.910 --> 18:53.270
Here!

18:53.860 --> 18:55.930
I forgot to take these off.

18:55.930 --> 18:57.970
It's easier to fly if you're lighter.

18:57.970 --> 18:58.590
Yeah!

18:59.090 --> 18:59.850
These guys...

19:01.280 --> 19:02.730
What?!

19:02.730 --> 19:04.110
The princess is...

19:04.110 --> 19:06.800
Is this a dream or is it an illusion?

19:06.800 --> 19:08.610
There are three princesses!

19:10.570 --> 19:12.120
Could this be...?

19:12.680 --> 19:16.990
The skill the first Magical King used when he united the Heavens...

19:17.220 --> 19:21.070
The legendary Magical King who defeated
every single army of all the other countries...

19:21.070 --> 19:26.050
The lost, ancient, legendary magic...

19:26.450 --> 19:33.300
...that allowed him to clone himself and appear at different places at the same time!

19:33.990 --> 19:36.200
She learned it so easily!

19:36.200 --> 19:37.030
As expected...

19:37.030 --> 19:38.730
As expected of the princess!

19:39.850 --> 19:41.560
We're filled with awe!

19:42.230 --> 19:43.070
Um...

19:45.170 --> 19:46.570
Is something the matter?

19:46.760 --> 19:48.320
No, well...

19:48.850 --> 19:53.580
We heard that Princess Yumemi had
successfully completed the preparation ritual.

19:53.580 --> 19:55.070
We just couldn't stay where we were.

19:56.900 --> 20:04.250
That ritual is originally for the sake of powerful mages who want to upgrade themselves.

20:04.250 --> 20:06.030
We nearly lost our lives to it.

20:06.030 --> 20:09.550
It's a really dangerous special training.

20:10.070 --> 20:15.340
Moreover, you used an amount of spirit that could support the whole sky!

20:15.340 --> 20:18.170
You must be really tired...

20:18.170 --> 20:21.390
...after completing that ritual!

20:21.810 --> 20:24.640
We've gotten permission from Lady Ryuely.

20:24.640 --> 20:25.870
Please take these.

20:27.310 --> 20:30.050
We thought that you'd like them.

20:30.050 --> 20:31.840
Thank you very much!

20:31.840 --> 20:33.090
Hello.

20:33.090 --> 20:34.240
Nice to meet you.

20:36.240 --> 20:37.320
I'm Ichiko.

20:37.320 --> 20:38.240
I'm Suzume.

20:39.340 --> 20:40.640
Fabulous!

20:40.640 --> 20:42.400
Amazing!

20:42.400 --> 20:49.370
You quickly grasped hold of the ancient magic even though you just completed the preparation just then!

20:49.370 --> 20:53.620
I can feel strong waves from all of you!

20:53.620 --> 20:55.640
This is the ultimate power!

20:56.150 --> 21:00.340
We now have three real princesses...

21:02.230 --> 21:03.400
Um...

21:03.930 --> 21:04.660
Princess.

21:04.660 --> 21:05.640
Yes?

21:05.640 --> 21:08.810
You're going to where Lord Munto is now, right?

21:10.870 --> 21:11.320
Yes.

21:12.450 --> 21:20.480
Because we're useless, Lord Munto has been shouldering the fate of this world ever since he was small.

21:20.480 --> 21:24.730
Even though he has an unyielding spirit, he has never shown his weak side.

21:24.730 --> 21:28.330
However, Lord Munto cannot hold up this world by himself.

21:28.930 --> 21:33.340
Princesses, please help Lord Munto.

21:37.720 --> 21:38.800
Don't worry.

21:40.680 --> 21:42.560
I won't let Munto be alone!

21:45.320 --> 21:47.060
Thank you.

21:49.740 --> 21:51.580
We'll be leaving now.

21:55.610 --> 21:56.650
No way...

22:21.540 --> 22:23.140
Come on, let's go!

24:31.800 --> 24:32.560
It's the final episode.

24:32.800 --> 24:33.980
It is, isn't it?

24:33.980 --> 24:35.150
It was long.

24:35.150 --> 24:37.380
Yeah, thanks for your hard work, Munto.

24:37.380 --> 24:39.170
Oh, yeah...

24:39.170 --> 24:41.280
Yumemi, if it's okay with you-

24:41.280 --> 24:42.180
No.

24:42.180 --> 24:42.860
I haven't even said anything!

24:43.620 --> 24:47.060
Next episode of The World Reflected in the Eyes of a Girl who Looks Up at the Sky:

24:47.060 --> 24:48.310
Love.
